            "review_text": "CanisHan\nSeoul, South Korea31300 contributions\n1\nrestaurant that serves breakfast in the Pandanus Resort\nSep 2025 • Friends\nC ( 25.09.29 )\nMy friend and I had breakfast here while staying at the Pandanus Resort. As a restaurant in the resort, the atmosphere is good and the food is diverse. The service is good, and it provides excellent breakfast. It is a delicious, diverse, and excellent restaurant for breakfast.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 3, 2025",
