            "review_title": "Review at Café Blue Lagoon Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Michael H\nMississauga, Canada24 contributions\n0\nGood Buffet breakfast\nMay 2019 • Couples\nGood buffet breakfast, good varieties, dinner was ok, food is nothing special and pricey. No aircon,\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 5, 2019\nPandanusResort\nThank you for staying at the Pandanus Resort and for dining in our Cafe Blue Lagoon restaurant. \n\nWe are disappointed that you felt our food was \"nothing special\", as we constantly make an effort to improve our dishes and the variety of items that we offer on the ala-carte menu. We have recently hired a local chef who was the head chef at a restaurant that had been listed as number one on TripAdvisor for a long period of time. The western items that he creates are not only delicious, but the presentation is nothing short of artistic.\n\nAs for the price of items in our restaurant, I challenge you to find comparable dishes that are less expensive in any luxury resort or hotel in your country. If you compare the items to street food or street-side restaurants in Vietnam that do not have our overhead, of course our prices will be higher.\n\nAs for your comment about air-conditioning; guests do not come here from countries around the world to dine in an enclosed air-conditioned setting. A few years ago, I built and opened a restaurant here in Mui Ne with one area that was open-air and another that was air-conditioned. The only time that diners ever wanted to sit in the air-conditioned area was once during a major storm.\nRead more\nWritten June 15, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
