            "review_title": "Review at Café Blue Lagoon Restaurant",
            "review_text": "CristsinaE\nGeneva, Switzerland12 contributions\n1\nWorthlessly pretentious\nJan 2019 • Couples\nThis restaurant is part of a resort. The food is really not worth the exaggerated prices, besides the fact that it’s a superficially fancy venue located in a poor and polluted area.\nWritten January 18, 2019\nPandanusResort\nDear CristsinaE,\n\nWe believe that you wrote this review about some other restaurant and mistakenly posted it to the Cafe Blue Lagoon page. \n\nThe Cafe Blue Lagoon has a very casual ambiance and it is located inside the most beautiful garden in all of Phan Thiet. The garden is extremely clean and unpolluted, and all the tropical plants and flowers are immaculately manicured. Another reason that we believe this review is not about the Cafe Blue Lagoon is that we are currently offering discounted prices at the restaurant for all guests in the resort because of the construction project going on adjacent to the property, so the prices are currently more reasonable than at any other four star hotel in the area.\nRead more\nWritten May 29, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
